oh-my-tikzc adapts the perspective-based recursive architecture documentation
workflow of oh-my-mermaid, especially skills/omm-scan/SKILL.md.

Upstream: https://github.com/oh-my-mermaid/oh-my-mermaid
Copyright (c) 2025 oh-my-mermaid
License: MIT (retained in LICENSE)

The adaptation replaces Mermaid/omm operations with native tikzc rendering,
source evidence, static Markdown navigation, and a shared Claude Code/Codex
skill package. No cloud workflow is included.

Renderer dependency: https://github.com/RyoNakagami/tikzc
tikzc is separately installed and is not redistributed by this package.
